# Contact form delivery
#
# The ID of your Formspree form (the part after /f/ in
# https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx).
#
# This is a public form identifier, not a secret key: it is designed to sit in
# a static front-end like a <form action> attribute. Create the form at
# formspree.io, set the destination address to abdelhadibouzani@gmail.com, then
# paste the ID below and restart the dev server.
#
# While this is empty the form still renders and validates, and shows a
# "not configured" message with a direct mailto: link instead of posting.
REACT_APP_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
